source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Create, inspect or restore an offline profile backup

Usage: mxr backup <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create   Preview or create a stopped-profile backup
  inspect  Validate and describe a backup without restoring it
  restore  Preview or restore into a new, empty profile
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
